WEBVTT

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:18.330
"July 2020 - Gulf of Alaska"

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:32.790
"Denali - Alaska"

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:48.750
Shit.

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:53.500
It's easy as hell to hit,
but it doesn't even give a damn.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:57.620
Zip it. Our mission's just to keep it occupied.

00:00:58.580 --> 00:01:00.000
Roger.

00:01:17.330 --> 00:01:22.450
Yeah! In your face!
How do you like them apples?!

00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:25.540
No, wait... That's...!

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.580
Spirit!

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:49.290
Tomahawk inbound. All aircraft, disengage.

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:50.700
Copy.

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:55.790
Come on, punk! Follow papa!

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:01.120
Does it know?!

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:06.750
Impact in ten, nine, eight, seven, six...

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:12.250
...five, four, three, two, one...!

00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:37.660
You're kidding!

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:56.830
That was the anomaly
that appeared in North America.

00:02:56.830 --> 00:03:02.910
As you can see, the attack
on the Pillar ended in utter failure.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:06.580
Their danger is now apparent
to the entire world.

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:10.450
This crisis threatens all of humanity.

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:14.580
It's been a year since
the mysterious Pillars appeared.

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:18.580
They cropped up on mountain
ranges around the world...

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:22.160
...and have encroached on our lands and homes.

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:25.870
Northern Europe has been completely abandoned.

00:03:25.870 --> 00:03:29.620
It's just a matter of time
till all of Europe follows.

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:33.870
There's only so many
refugees that Asia can take in.

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:36.290
We need to address this quickly.

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:39.620
But our attack on the Pillar was a failure.

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:42.250
If nuclear warheads did nothing,

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:47.040
I doubt further attacks
will prove any more effective.

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:53.580
Not only is our enemy unknown,
but we're completely unable to harm them.

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:57.790
Is there nothing we can do but lie down and die?

00:03:57.790 --> 00:04:01.290
We need to think positive.
It's too early to give up.

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:03.040
But...!

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:05.910
How will abandoning our duties help?

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:09.870
Would you have us sit around and pray to god?!

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:12.450
Wh-What the--?

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:20.080
You look so distraught, humans.

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:23.870
However, I respect your tenacity.

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:26.410
I think I'll lend you a hand.

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:30.790
What's a child doing here?! How did you get in?!

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:32.500
Just who are you?

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.080
A god.

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:36.700
Hmph. Don't be ridiculous.

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:39.540
Perhaps this will convince you.

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:52.450
I am the chief of gods, Odin.

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:55.830
Men turn to god when faced with trouble.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:59.750
Therefore, I shall save you, humans.

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:05.040
To clarify, I will bestow
you with a means to fight.

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:09.080
What is this means you speak of?

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:12.200
Oh? You're quick to believe me.

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:17.660
At this point, I'll take help from anyone,
even a self-proclaimed god.

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:21.160
You're so rude... Yet decisive.

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:24.290
Your decision will save humanity.

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:25.620
Look.

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:29.330
Who's she?

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:34.450
One who will topple the Pillars
and rescue humanity from destruction.

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:37.950
My beloved daughter, Valkyrie.

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:43.580
You're saying this girl
is the savior of humanity?

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:46.410
It's time to strike back, humans.

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:49.660
Resist your destruction! Fight!

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:52.450
The great battle is near.

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:55.410
The coming of Ragnarök is nigh.

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:08.830
"5 Years Later - June 2025"
"The Alps - Mont Blanc"

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:12.750
This is Richthofen 1. Target in sight.

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:18.000
Fluke 1 here. Sorry for the holdup.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:22.250
You're late, John Bull.
Our target's Mont Blanc Pillar.

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:26.580
Rock and roll!

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:36.830
The target's only open to attack
from above! Try to keep up!

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:43.200
Maintain speed or you'll get hosed!

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:47.540
Shit! Bandits on my ass!

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:54.370
Dammit!

00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:58.830
Shit! Can't shake 'em!

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:00.370
At this rate...

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:02.040
Come in!

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:04.910
Richthofen 1 here. I'm in trouble.

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:07.620
All aircraft! Way to hang in there!

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:09.500
Rejoice!

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:11.870
A Valkyrie's here!

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:17.500
May these barbaric enemies begone!

00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:23.830
She's using a machine gun?

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:29.370
It's Odin's divine protection!
Our Valkyrie, Schwertleite!

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:34.790
All pilots: this is Valkyrie Schwertleite.

00:07:34.790 --> 00:07:36.700
Engage all bandits!

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:40.700
The enemy is straight ahead!
Attack! Attack! Attack!

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:42.160
Copy!

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:51.250
I see it! Bomb squad, attack!

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:52.620
Roger!

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:00.370
Did it work?!

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:01.910
No...

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:23.200
Is there nothing we can do?! It's too solid!

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:24.870
There is!

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:28.040
Just buy me three seconds!

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:31.200
Three seconds, huh? Roger!

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:33.120
We're gonna start counting!

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:37.540
One! Two! Three!

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:46.500
It's a three-use Magic Missile,
but now's the time to use one!

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:56.750
Take this! Tyrfing!

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:24.750
Shit...

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:29.830
Ain't that beautiful?

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:34.750
All aircraft, come in.

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:38.250
This is Schwertleite. Come in.

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:41.120
This is Valkyrie Schwertleite.

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:44.950
Someone... Someone come in.

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:52.660
Am I... the only one again?

00:09:57.830 --> 00:10:00.160
I'm being reassigned?

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:05.540
That's right. It's a big blow to us,
but you know how politics work.

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:08.660
I'm not gonna stand for this!

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:11.540
Wasn't the Secondary attack a success?!

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:14.330
Why would we drop the MVP?!

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:17.410
Liz, don't blow a fuse.

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:20.370
Still, I agree with her.

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:23.370
What happened?

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:26.120
Japan's Named was killed in action.

00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:30.120
Ortlinde?! Do we know for sure?!

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:33.080
Unfortunately, it's true.

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:36.410
You're... kidding...

00:10:36.410 --> 00:10:40.830
Sakura... That dummy...

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:45.660
Then, that's where I'm moving?

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:52.580
Yes. Orders from above say to
reassign one of Europe's Named to Japan.

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:54.790
Since we've held back the enemy,

00:10:54.790 --> 00:11:00.000
they say Europe having three of
humanity's best weapons is too much.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:06.370
But... But why Claudia?! Why not me or Lily?!

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:09.870
Don't waste your time worrying why.

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:13.750
A casualty rate of 99.9%...

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:17.120
In battle, there's zero survivors except for me.

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:22.370
I'm not worthy of the title,
"Valkyrie of Salvation."

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:26.660
I'm... the Grim Reaper.

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:28.870
Don't say that!

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:39.160
Commander. Your orders?

00:11:39.160 --> 00:11:43.080
You're reassigned to Japan. Best of luck.

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:45.870
If it were your order...

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:47.910
...I'd give you my eye.

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:56.250
"Hero Wing Long-Range Transport"
"A800ZM Typhoon"

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:08.870
I'm a Grim Reaper sent off
to be someone else's problem.

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:13.790
For a Valkyrie who's supposed
to have god's blessing, it's ironic.

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:20.750
Will everyone avoid me here too?

00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:23.540
Listen, Claudia.

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:28.500
First impressions are really important.
Just remember that.

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:32.250
That's right. It's really easy to misjudge you.

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:36.120
First impressions... Misjudge...

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:39.540
Do my eyes make me look mad or something?

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:43.910
Sorry!

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:46.160
Enemy below at 2 o'clock!

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:49.950
I see it too! Radar reads 10 miles away!

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:52.000
It's Tertiary class!

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:54.040
A newly formed Pillar, huh?

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:58.370
It's on water, so it can't last long.
We'll keep our distance.

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:00.120
Change course!

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:04.700
That was close! How did you know?

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:07.540
My gut. Anyways, what's it after?

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:10.700
We're the only ones out here. It's after us!

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:14.660
There was no warning from Gjallarhorn.
What a warm welcome.

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:16.410
What should we do?

00:13:16.410 --> 00:13:19.580
There's not much choice. I'm going out.

00:13:19.580 --> 00:13:22.660
Roger. Ascending to launch altitude.

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:27.160
You heard him, I'm air launching.
Prepare to sortie!

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:28.200
Roger!

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:29.700
Prepping engine!

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:32.040
Machine gun ammo, check!

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:35.620
Condition: good. Ordnance: minimal.

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:38.660
Wingmen: none. Courage: plenty.

00:13:38.660 --> 00:13:41.200
You're on your own. Is that okay?

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:42.950
It's nothing new.

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:45.160
I'm used to fighting alone.

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:47.370
Found you!

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:50.540
Hero Cannon, fire!

00:13:55.200 --> 00:13:56.910
That attack just now...

00:13:56.910 --> 00:14:00.660
Here we are! Friendly forces have arrived!

00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:05.160
What the heck?! Why'd you
shoot one of your precious missiles?!

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:07.450
Have you heard nothing I've said?!

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:12.120
Strike first! Blow 'em up at the start!
That's the secret to victory!

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:14.080
And if you don't blow 'em up?!

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:16.040
Then you and Sono will!

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:17.500
R-Reinforcements!

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:20.000
Reinforcements? Not the circus?

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.870
Hey, transport!

00:14:21.870 --> 00:14:24.290
We'll take care of the enemy!

00:14:24.290 --> 00:14:28.040
Let's try this again!
From now on, do what I say and--

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:29.330
Hey, Sono!

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:34.790
Oh. Sorry, Azu! It's just, work takes priority.

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:38.500
They threw weapons on a 72 made for racing?!

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:40.290
That's their Hero Wing?!

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:42.410
Would you guys just listen to--

00:14:42.410 --> 00:14:45.540
Take this! Teeny Hero Cannon!

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:48.450
Friendly forces! At this rate...!

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:50.200
No, this is bad.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:51.000
Huh?!

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:54.540
One mistake and it'll end in disaster.

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:56.250
I'm going out.

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:58.410
Schwertleite!

00:14:58.410 --> 00:14:59.950
Here.

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:05.370
Thank you.

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:06.580
Time to launch!

00:15:06.580 --> 00:15:08.370
Good luck!

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:32.250
It's going all out with no way to replenish...

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:36.870
Hey! What are you doing?!
I said we'd take care of it!

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:39.910
Blade 1 here. Thanks for coming.

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:43.620
But I can't stand just watching. Let me help.

00:15:43.620 --> 00:15:46.700
Just so you know, you'll only hold us back!

00:15:46.700 --> 00:15:47.910
Ahead! Incoming!

00:15:47.910 --> 00:15:49.290
Huh?!

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:56.370
Still think I'll hold you back?

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:59.120
Anonym here. Just don't crash.

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:04.250
Right. In any case,
there's not a proper plane among you.

00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:08.870
No proper pilots either.
Please tell me that you are.

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:10.370
I try.

00:16:10.370 --> 00:16:12.410
What's your course of action?

00:16:12.410 --> 00:16:14.870
It's just small fry and no boss.

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:18.790
We can just stall until
the enemy runs out of juice.

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:21.450
Agreed. You've got a good read.

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:25.000
Think you could try telling that to them?

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:27.000
They seem decent at flying.

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.830
It's their heads--they're empty.

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:31.580
How about their ears?

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:32.790
Ears?

00:16:32.790 --> 00:16:36.000
Here's hoping they listen to me.

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:38.200
Red plane! Pink plane!

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:41.870
This is Schwertleite! I'm taking command!

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:43.410
Sherbet light?

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:44.660
A Named?

00:16:44.660 --> 00:16:48.790
Schwertleite?!
That's one of the nine S-Class pilots!

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:49.500
Huh?!

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:50.660
S-Glass?

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:51.700
Do you copy?!

00:16:51.700 --> 00:16:53.410
--Roger!
--Copy that!

00:16:53.410 --> 00:16:56.410
It's not power that's needed, but endurance.

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:58.660
Wait for it to run out of energy.

00:16:58.660 --> 00:16:59.790
How long?

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:02.120
Hold on. Anonym?

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:02.950
Me?!

00:17:02.950 --> 00:17:04.410
How long will it be?

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:08.250
Um... Well, it's Tertiary class...

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:12.540
Based on its total energy
and how much it's already used...

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:15.120
About 400 seconds at most!

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:16.700
Good. Hear that?

00:17:16.700 --> 00:17:20.250
We've gotta play tag with it for 400 seconds.

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:23.120
Work together and attack in waves.

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:26.830
Red. Pink. Maintain speed and poke at it!

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:27.700
Got it!

00:17:27.700 --> 00:17:29.000
My specialty!

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:30.040
Anonym.

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:33.450
Would you like me to stay on your left wing?

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:35.500
That's fine. Try to keep up.

00:17:35.500 --> 00:17:38.950
Show us what an S-Class is made--
Huh?! What the heck?!

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:42.450
Let's get down to business.
Pink. Break right in five.

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:45.040
Red. Send it a wake-up call.

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:47.290
--Roger!
--Copy that!

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:49.660
Hero Cannon two!

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:52.750
Fire!

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:54.330
Azu's never this clear!

00:17:54.330 --> 00:17:56.200
Azu's never this helpful!

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:58.290
You guys are making me cry!

00:17:58.290 --> 00:18:00.370
Anonym. Can you keep up?

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:01.750
Haven't I been?!

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:02.870
Behind us!

00:18:02.870 --> 00:18:04.910
Again?!

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:07.910
Shoot! Crap! It's breaking! It's breaking!

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:10.330
Teeny Hero Cannon!

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:11.830
You okay, Azu?

00:18:11.830 --> 00:18:15.330
Ugh! Watch out, they're on you!

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:21.200
If it used this much...

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:23.250
Countdown! Forty seconds!

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:26.080
Thirty-nine! Thirty... eight?

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:29.790
Huh?

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:32.450
Zero! Yay! We win!

00:18:32.450 --> 00:18:35.080
Thank goodness!

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:40.540
Mission complete. It ran out
of energy quicker than we thought.

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:44.040
The transport is safe too. Nice teamwork.

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:45.910
Thanks for the backup.

00:18:45.910 --> 00:18:50.000
You too! That was pretty sick! I'm speechless!

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:53.750
Careful, Miko! Treat the
Named with more respect!

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:56.830
Aww, come on! Don't be a stiff!

00:18:56.830 --> 00:19:00.160
Don't call me a stiff! I'm not Azu!

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:02.950
You... guys... are... dead!

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:08.410
Whew! Azu's scary!
Anyways, see you later, S-Size!

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:10.950
Not S-Size! S-Class!

00:19:10.950 --> 00:19:15.500
Sheesh! Nice to meet you! We'll be on our way!

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:17.870
Those guys are unbelievable!

00:19:17.870 --> 00:19:20.830
So? Did I meet your standards?

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:24.250
Nice one. You've got S-Class sarcasm too.

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:24.950
Sarcasm?

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:29.410
Are you clueless?! Argh, sheesh!
Thanks for taking command.

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:31.290
See you around.

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:35.040
Yeah. May the wings ever guide you.

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:37.160
May the wings guide you.

00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:45.790
Oh... I forgot to ask which wing they're with.

00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:48.330
My lively little sisters...

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:53.870
May we meet again in the sky.

00:19:57.410 --> 00:19:59.120
Oh! Hi-ya!

00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:01.910
We meet again! It's been so long!

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:06.000
So long...

00:20:06.790 --> 00:20:09.410
Sigururi!

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:13.290
"Tateyama Base HQ"

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:21.370
Whew! That's more like it!
Been waiting long?

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:24.120
No, it's all right.

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:28.000
I'm Claudia Bruford! As of today,
I've been reassigned to--

00:20:28.000 --> 00:20:30.910
Whoa, whoa, whoa! Too formal!

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:32.200
Huh?!

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:36.080
I've got the crew here preparing
for your welcome party.

00:20:36.080 --> 00:20:39.000
If you act like that, it won't be much fun.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:41.290
A welcome party, you say?

00:20:41.290 --> 00:20:44.790
Yeah. Though, with the Pillar showing up at sea,

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:51.040
it's pretty much on hold until
after the Level 2 Alert gets called off.

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:56.450
H-Hold on. Do you not
know who I am, Commander?

00:20:56.450 --> 00:21:01.950
I read your papers--I know.
You're one of our precious Named.

00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:04.500
But who doesn't like welcome parties?

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:10.040
Anyways! Since we're on Level 2 Alert,
you can't unpack yet.

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:14.410
Would you like a tour
of the base until it's over?

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:15.790
All right.

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:18.000
Wonderful. Your tour guide will be--

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:22.750
Me, me, me! Me, who won rock paper scissors!

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:26.330
There you have it. Get along with her, okay?

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:34.450
I totally wanted to show you around!
I'm so glad I won!

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:37.540
I'm Miyako! Miyako Muguruma!

00:21:37.540 --> 00:21:41.500
Pilot of the red 44! Nice to meet you!

00:21:41.500 --> 00:21:43.330
I'm Claudia Bruford.

00:21:43.330 --> 00:21:49.040
Bruford... Claudia... Hmm... It's tough to say!

00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:51.330
I-Is it?

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:53.200
What nice scenery here.

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:58.500
Oh! Aren't our palm trees cool?!
The resort atmosphere is our selling point!

00:21:58.500 --> 00:21:59.500
Selling point?

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:00.950
Selling point!

00:22:00.950 --> 00:22:05.120
Since we're on alert and all,
we can't leave the base, but...

00:22:05.120 --> 00:22:07.120
...what do you wanna see, Claudy?

00:22:07.120 --> 00:22:10.080
Let's see. Your facilities like... Wait!

00:22:10.080 --> 00:22:11.620
Waiting!

00:22:11.620 --> 00:22:13.540
What was that "Claudy" about?

00:22:13.540 --> 00:22:15.750
Because! Claudia is Claudy!

00:22:15.750 --> 00:22:18.540
I've been called "Claudette" before, but...

00:22:18.540 --> 00:22:20.620
That's way too hard!

00:22:20.620 --> 00:22:23.660
You can call me Miyako or Miko!

00:22:23.660 --> 00:22:25.120
Sure, but...

00:22:25.120 --> 00:22:28.250
Oh! You can call me something else too!

00:22:28.250 --> 00:22:29.750
I'll think about it.

00:22:29.750 --> 00:22:33.870
Okay, Claudy! Oh! How about the hanger?!

00:22:33.870 --> 00:22:34.330
Huh?

00:22:34.330 --> 00:22:36.500
Your Hero Wing's there too!

00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:38.200
W-Wait up!

00:22:38.200 --> 00:22:39.660
Hey! It's Miko!

00:22:39.660 --> 00:22:41.830
Sorry to bother!

00:22:41.830 --> 00:22:43.290
What's up?

00:22:44.200 --> 00:22:48.540
I'm a tour guide showing Claudy around the base!

00:22:48.540 --> 00:22:52.750
Wait! Are you telling me
that beauty's the newcomer?!

00:22:52.750 --> 00:22:54.250
Lemme see!

00:22:54.250 --> 00:22:56.000
Whoa! A European babe!

00:22:56.000 --> 00:22:57.830
A blonde Valkyrie!

00:22:57.830 --> 00:23:00.580
Hey, hey! You're scaring Claudy!

00:23:00.580 --> 00:23:03.250
Quit creeping on her! Shoo!

00:23:03.250 --> 00:23:05.450
C'mon! You're no fun, Miko!

00:23:05.450 --> 00:23:06.080
--You damn brats! What are you doing?!

00:23:06.080 --> 00:23:08.790
--Shoot!
--Uh-oh!
--You damn brats! What are you doing?!

00:23:08.790 --> 00:23:12.250
You all act like such brats, it's unbelievable!

00:23:12.250 --> 00:23:15.330
Agreed, agreed! They're such brats!

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:17.290
You too, Ki-44!

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:18.830
Oh, is that right?

00:23:18.830 --> 00:23:20.790
Good grief.

00:23:20.790 --> 00:23:23.830
Are you the Valkyrie flying the Gladiator?

00:23:23.830 --> 00:23:26.370
Y-Yeah. That's right. I'm Cl--

00:23:26.370 --> 00:23:28.540
Whoa! Don't know! Don't care!

00:23:28.540 --> 00:23:29.370
Huh?

00:23:29.370 --> 00:23:35.250
I can tell all about a pilot by their plane.
That's good enough for me.

00:23:35.250 --> 00:23:38.910
I'll keep her in tip-top shape for you.

00:23:38.910 --> 00:23:40.830
Push her to the limit.

00:23:40.830 --> 00:23:44.290
Hey, brats! It's time for lots of fun work!

00:23:44.290 --> 00:23:45.080
Yes, sir!

00:23:45.080 --> 00:23:46.450
--Ki-44 got beat up,
so I want every screw tightened!

00:23:46.450 --> 00:23:48.290
--Wow! That's awesome, Claudy!
--Ki-44 got beat up,
so I want every screw tightened!

00:23:48.290 --> 00:23:48.790
--Wow! That's awesome, Claudy!

00:23:48.790 --> 00:23:49.000
--What was?

00:23:49.000 --> 00:23:50.160
--What was?
--Nobody takes a break
until its ready to take off!

00:23:50.160 --> 00:23:52.500
--He's got high hopes for you!
He never says anything like that!
--Nobody takes a break
until its ready to take off!

00:23:52.500 --> 00:23:53.660
--He's got high hopes for you!
He never says anything like that!

00:23:53.660 --> 00:23:54.910
--He's got high hopes for you!
He never says anything like that!
--Listen, morons! Maintenance
doesn't know the meaning of sleep!

00:23:54.910 --> 00:23:56.660
--High hopes? That?
--Listen, morons! Maintenance
doesn't know the meaning of sleep!

00:23:56.660 --> 00:23:58.870
--I know, right? He's nuts!
--Listen, morons! Maintenance
doesn't know the meaning of sleep!

00:23:58.870 --> 00:24:00.790
Shut your mouth, Ki-44!

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:04.330
Whoa! Run! Run! Sorry to bother!

00:24:04.330 --> 00:24:06.330
G-Goodbye!

00:24:06.330 --> 00:24:07.540
Here we are! Food to boost our spirits!

00:24:07.540 --> 00:24:09.410
"Cafeteria"

00:24:09.410 --> 00:24:13.080
"Cafeteria"

00:24:13.080 --> 00:24:17.830
"Cafeteria"
You know, 'cuz that
empty stomach fighting thing.

00:24:17.830 --> 00:24:20.540
"Cafeteria"

00:24:20.540 --> 00:24:22.410
Yeah! I almost had it!

00:24:22.410 --> 00:24:26.080
So, when it comes to the food,
I recommend curry!

00:24:26.080 --> 00:24:27.250
Huh?

00:24:27.250 --> 00:24:30.660
Miko? We're still on standby.

00:24:30.660 --> 00:24:32.000
Oh?

00:24:32.000 --> 00:24:34.290
Thanks for giving the base tour.

00:24:34.290 --> 00:24:36.160
Are you a Valkyrie here?

00:24:36.160 --> 00:24:40.660
Yes! Sorry for not saying sooner!
I'm Sonoka Watarai.

00:24:40.660 --> 00:24:42.830
Um, I'm "Pink."

00:24:42.830 --> 00:24:45.620
The 72? What a surprise.

00:24:45.620 --> 00:24:49.370
For being that good of a pilot, you're so young.

00:24:49.370 --> 00:24:52.660
Right? Sono's our youngest ace!

00:24:52.660 --> 00:24:54.580
She's our speed demon!

00:24:54.580 --> 00:24:57.290
Miko! I don't like being a "demon."

00:24:57.290 --> 00:25:00.410
Really? Aren't they cool and on fire?

00:25:00.410 --> 00:25:02.160
That's not cool at all!

00:25:02.160 --> 00:25:03.750
--Huh? Well I think they're cool...

00:25:03.750 --> 00:25:05.790
--You're Claudia, right?
--Huh? Well I think they're cool...

00:25:05.790 --> 00:25:09.950
Uh, sorry. I should've said sooner.
I'm Claudia Bruford.

00:25:09.950 --> 00:25:14.080
I'm calling her "Claudy" so you should too!

00:25:14.080 --> 00:25:17.040
All right! Claudy it is!

00:25:17.040 --> 00:25:19.040
Claudy's a shy one!

00:25:19.040 --> 00:25:21.790
"Cafeteria"
Oh! And because of the standby...

00:25:21.790 --> 00:25:25.790
"Cafeteria"
Yup! The cafeteria people are all on the field.

00:25:26.620 --> 00:25:30.000
You're right!
Today's secret ingredient is loquat jam!

00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:33.040
Wait... Isn't the cafeteria shut down?

00:25:33.040 --> 00:25:36.580
Well, "you can't fight on an empty tummy"!

00:25:36.580 --> 00:25:38.950
"You can't fight on an empty stomach."

00:25:38.950 --> 00:25:41.160
Seeing is believing! Let's go!

00:25:41.160 --> 00:25:45.450
Miko is saying, "Come and see what I mean."

00:25:45.450 --> 00:25:47.250
Got it.

00:25:47.250 --> 00:25:48.000
Here. One tasty plate
for the beautiful Valkyrie.

00:25:48.000 --> 00:25:51.790
"Loquat Curry"
"Soup Kitchen"
Here. One tasty plate
for the beautiful Valkyrie.

00:25:51.790 --> 00:25:53.120
"Loquat Curry"
"Soup Kitchen"

00:25:53.120 --> 00:25:55.950
"Loquat Curry"
"Soup Kitchen"

00:25:55.950 --> 00:25:59.120
"Loquat Curry"
"Soup Kitchen"

00:25:59.120 --> 00:25:59.910
"Loquat Curry"
"Soup Kitchen"

00:25:59.910 --> 00:26:02.750
"Loquat Curry"
"Soup Kitchen"

00:26:05.370 --> 00:26:07.370
This isn't normal.

00:26:07.370 --> 00:26:11.080
True. I think so too.

00:26:11.080 --> 00:26:16.250
Huh, really? I love this
kinda atmosphere though!

00:26:16.250 --> 00:26:20.250
Oh, it's Azu! So popular with the kids!

00:26:20.250 --> 00:26:22.750
She's good at caring for people.

00:26:23.450 --> 00:26:26.620
It looks like she's signaling for help though.

00:26:26.620 --> 00:26:29.700
You're right. Good eyes, Claudy.

00:26:29.700 --> 00:26:34.450
Miko. Why don't you help
before she locks herself in her room?

00:26:34.450 --> 00:26:36.620
Oh, good point.

00:26:40.290 --> 00:26:42.080
Thanks for the meal!

00:26:43.410 --> 00:26:46.410
I'll be right back!

00:26:46.410 --> 00:26:49.000
Azu! Pass the baton!

00:26:57.080 --> 00:27:02.910
Shit! Those damn kids won't leave me alone!

00:27:02.910 --> 00:27:07.160
Why? Were they voicing
their concerns about the military?

00:27:07.160 --> 00:27:10.330
You've gotta be kidding! They're just brats!

00:27:11.790 --> 00:27:14.290
So you're Schwertleite, huh?

00:27:14.290 --> 00:27:16.500
You must be Anonym.

00:27:16.500 --> 00:27:19.790
I appreciate the support yesterday. Thank you.

00:27:19.790 --> 00:27:25.750
Hah! Gimme a break! As if someone
of your skill needs our support!

00:27:25.750 --> 00:27:27.910
Just so you know, I'm--eep!

00:27:27.910 --> 00:27:29.250
Eep?

00:27:29.250 --> 00:27:32.750
Azu! Don't even start!

00:27:32.750 --> 00:27:36.450
I know you're protecting
your turf from the newcomer,

00:27:36.450 --> 00:27:38.790
but Miko will hate you for it.

00:27:38.790 --> 00:27:41.040
I-I am not!

00:27:41.040 --> 00:27:44.120
As if I care what that idiot thinks of me!

00:27:44.120 --> 00:27:48.790
Stop trying to act tough.
You're so bad at hiding secrets, Azu.

00:27:48.790 --> 00:27:51.250
Can't hear you!
Can't hear you! Can't hear you!

00:27:51.250 --> 00:27:53.750
You're much different than I imagined.

00:27:53.750 --> 00:27:55.620
She's very friendly!

00:27:55.620 --> 00:27:57.660
Don't try to humiliate me!

00:27:57.660 --> 00:27:59.540
I see. Very friendly.

00:27:59.540 --> 00:28:01.250
Don't agree with her!

00:28:01.250 --> 00:28:06.540
Listen well! I'm Azuzu Komagome,
leader of the Valkyrie at this base!

00:28:06.540 --> 00:28:08.250
Um, sorry but...

00:28:08.250 --> 00:28:10.370
Shut up and listen.

00:28:10.370 --> 00:28:13.950
That's better. As I was saying--

00:28:13.950 --> 00:28:16.200
I was trying to warn you.

00:28:16.200 --> 00:28:18.620
It's not your fault, Claudy.

00:28:18.620 --> 00:28:21.910
Sorry, Azu! You okay?!

00:28:21.910 --> 00:28:23.160
Grr!

00:28:23.160 --> 00:28:26.120
You... big... idiot!

00:28:26.120 --> 00:28:28.250
Oh my!

00:28:28.250 --> 00:28:32.790
You okay, Azu? You should
know you have zero athleticism!

00:28:32.790 --> 00:28:37.290
It can't be zero!
It's at least one! Don't be stupid!

00:28:43.660 --> 00:28:47.580
Ah, jeez! You're filthy! You should go change!

00:28:47.580 --> 00:28:50.370
I know. Here, your ball.

00:28:50.370 --> 00:28:51.950
Yeah, thanks!

00:28:51.950 --> 00:28:54.910
Hey, Miko! Hurry up!

00:28:54.910 --> 00:28:57.660
Yay! Game on!

00:28:57.660 --> 00:29:00.370
Ah, crap. I lost my venom.

00:29:00.370 --> 00:29:03.950
I feel like venom is better not to have.

00:29:03.950 --> 00:29:08.160
I think Azu prefers to have some.

00:29:08.160 --> 00:29:10.160
What a strange base.

00:29:10.160 --> 00:29:13.330
Yeah, this is a strange base.

00:29:13.330 --> 00:29:15.950
A lax commander, chummy idiots...

00:29:15.950 --> 00:29:19.620
Stubborn mechanics,
kids who think its a playground...

00:29:19.620 --> 00:29:21.790
It's a strange base.

00:29:21.790 --> 00:29:24.000
So? What about you?

00:29:24.000 --> 00:29:24.790
Huh?

00:29:24.790 --> 00:29:27.200
Ortlinde has fallen.

00:29:27.200 --> 00:29:31.000
We knew there'd be a
Named to replace her, but...

00:29:31.000 --> 00:29:33.830
The elite bases are Hyakuri and Hamamatsu.

00:29:33.830 --> 00:29:38.160
I don't get why you'd come
to Tateyama way in the rear.

00:29:38.160 --> 00:29:39.450
That's...

00:29:39.450 --> 00:29:42.120
You must be here for a reason.

00:29:43.120 --> 00:29:45.500
Grim Reaper Claudia.

00:29:45.500 --> 00:29:48.250
Azu, that's too much prying.

00:29:48.250 --> 00:29:51.250
It's 'cuz she's not saying anything!

00:29:52.290 --> 00:29:55.080
I'm called the Grim Reaper.

00:29:55.080 --> 00:29:57.000
Huh?

00:29:57.000 --> 00:29:59.750
I won't be welcome here for long.

00:29:59.750 --> 00:30:02.120
Soon, everyone will know.

00:30:02.120 --> 00:30:07.500
One of Europe's best Valkyrie,
Schwertleite, huh?

00:30:09.370 --> 00:30:10.450
One of Odin's favorite pets...

00:30:10.450 --> 00:30:12.000
"Azuzu"
One of Odin's favorite pets...

00:30:12.000 --> 00:30:13.370
"Azuzu"
Humanity's brightest mind...

00:30:13.370 --> 00:30:14.500
"Sonoka"
Humanity's brightest mind...

00:30:14.500 --> 00:30:17.410
"Sonoka"
Refugees from the hell of Hyakuri...

00:30:17.410 --> 00:30:21.500
Good grief. What's the brass expect from me?

00:30:21.500 --> 00:30:23.250
Kick!

00:30:23.250 --> 00:30:26.540
Whoa. Look at it go.

00:30:26.540 --> 00:30:29.950
Aww! Miko's out playing soccer!

00:30:29.950 --> 00:30:33.080
What happened to being on standby?

00:30:33.080 --> 00:30:38.950
But when Pillars appear on water,
they use up their energy and disappear.

00:30:38.950 --> 00:30:41.870
The alert will be over in no time.

00:30:41.870 --> 00:30:42.870
The radar?!

00:30:42.870 --> 00:30:44.660
It's an early warning!

00:30:44.660 --> 00:30:47.410
It's 40 kilometers SSW!

00:30:50.120 --> 00:30:52.410
Gjallarhorn! Evacuate the civilians--

00:30:52.410 --> 00:30:53.290
Everyone! Hurry to the shelter!

00:30:53.290 --> 00:30:54.950
"Loquat Curry"
"Shelter"
Everyone! Hurry to the shelter!

00:30:54.950 --> 00:30:57.200
"Loquat Curry"
"Shelter"
Run along, girls!

00:30:57.200 --> 00:30:59.660
Good luck, you guys!

00:30:59.660 --> 00:31:02.370
Yeah! Just leave it to us!

00:31:02.370 --> 00:31:04.660
Claudy, let's go!

00:31:04.660 --> 00:31:07.120
You must be here for a reason.

00:31:07.120 --> 00:31:10.500
A casualty rate of 99.9%...

00:31:10.500 --> 00:31:11.080
--I'm... the Grim Reaper.

00:31:11.080 --> 00:31:12.660
--Claudy?
--I'm... the Grim Reaper.

00:31:12.660 --> 00:31:14.200
Claudy!

00:31:14.200 --> 00:31:15.750
Something wrong?

00:31:15.750 --> 00:31:18.500
No, it's nothing.

00:31:18.500 --> 00:31:19.580
Let's go.

00:31:19.580 --> 00:31:20.700
Yeah!

00:31:20.700 --> 00:31:22.500
Checklist was A-OK!

00:31:22.500 --> 00:31:23.910
Good. Sono?

00:31:23.910 --> 00:31:25.660
Good here too!

00:31:25.660 --> 00:31:27.200
How's my 44?

00:31:27.200 --> 00:31:29.200
All set! You're good to go!

00:31:29.200 --> 00:31:32.080
That's my man! I love you!

00:31:33.410 --> 00:31:35.250
Whoops!

00:31:44.830 --> 00:31:46.290
That quickly?

00:31:46.290 --> 00:31:51.200
Hah! That's almost insulting.
The hanger is our battlefield.

00:31:51.200 --> 00:31:54.080
I don't screw around when it comes to war.

00:31:54.080 --> 00:31:58.870
I see. In that case,
we'll go all out in the sky.

00:31:58.870 --> 00:32:00.660
Hmph! We'll see.

00:32:00.660 --> 00:32:04.000
Go get 'em, Gladiator Valkyrie.

00:32:04.000 --> 00:32:06.250
Show me your wings!

00:32:06.250 --> 00:32:10.330
909th Valkyrie Wing! All planes, take off!

00:32:10.330 --> 00:32:14.040
Sigrdrifa 909, liftoff!

00:32:22.120 --> 00:32:25.160
Sure is busy for your first day, Claudy!

00:32:25.160 --> 00:32:26.830
Well, I'm used to it.

00:32:26.830 --> 00:32:30.160
To reassignment? Or attacks your first day?

00:32:30.160 --> 00:32:31.910
Both, really.

00:32:31.910 --> 00:32:34.330
Whoa, cool! Claudy's cool!

00:32:34.330 --> 00:32:37.870
I can't say I'm used to either of those!

00:32:37.870 --> 00:32:42.040
Quit your useless yapping.
At this speed, we should be close.

00:32:42.040 --> 00:32:45.700
I see it. It's the same type as yesterday.

00:32:45.700 --> 00:32:48.620
Hah! That's not nearly enough to scare...

00:32:48.620 --> 00:32:49.700
Azu...

00:32:49.700 --> 00:32:52.080
D-Don't blame it on me!

00:32:52.080 --> 00:32:54.500
Multiple Tertiary confirmed.

00:32:54.500 --> 00:32:57.790
They're increasing. They're expendable weapons!

00:32:57.790 --> 00:33:02.370
In other words, here they come!

00:33:02.370 --> 00:33:03.700
There's so many!

00:33:03.700 --> 00:33:07.620
They have nowhere to replenish,
so they're going all out!

00:33:07.620 --> 00:33:10.910
In that case, I'll take 'em head on! Whoa!

00:33:10.910 --> 00:33:13.500
Don't panic. Wait for opportunities.

00:33:13.500 --> 00:33:16.660
Using this much energy, they won't last long.

00:33:16.660 --> 00:33:20.160
So, we stall and keep them from reaching land?

00:33:20.160 --> 00:33:22.040
Yeah. That's the plan.

00:33:22.040 --> 00:33:24.080
Um, something seems odd.

00:33:24.080 --> 00:33:28.080
Can you stop being
totally ambiguous? What's odd?

00:33:28.080 --> 00:33:30.250
I don't know! It feels funny!

00:33:30.250 --> 00:33:32.290
That doesn't help us at all!

00:33:32.290 --> 00:33:33.750
No...

00:33:36.370 --> 00:33:39.370
The enemy is resupplying somehow!

00:33:39.370 --> 00:33:42.870
Our stalling strategy won't work!

00:33:42.870 --> 00:33:45.000
But it's on water!

00:33:45.000 --> 00:33:49.160
Without land,
Pillars can't resupply their energy!

00:33:49.160 --> 00:33:51.580
Is it sneaky and carrying land?

00:33:51.580 --> 00:33:54.910
A-Argh, shit! That's it!

00:33:54.910 --> 00:33:56.620
Stupid Miyako is right!

00:33:56.620 --> 00:33:57.290
Huh?!

00:33:57.290 --> 00:33:58.870
It's carrying land?!

00:33:58.870 --> 00:34:01.450
The part about sneaky!

00:34:01.450 --> 00:34:03.580
It's not on the radar!

00:34:03.580 --> 00:34:05.910
Because the enemy...

00:34:05.910 --> 00:34:07.700
...is underwater!

00:34:14.700 --> 00:34:16.040
Sigururi.

00:34:18.750 --> 00:34:23.160
Currently, we're fighting
the Pillars with standard weapons.

00:34:23.160 --> 00:34:27.250
As you know, even if those crack their armor...

00:34:27.250 --> 00:34:30.330
They're unable to destroy a Pillar.

00:34:30.330 --> 00:34:31.870
To defeat a Pillar,

00:34:31.870 --> 00:34:35.620
you must sever the
Vandrande's link to the ground.

00:34:35.620 --> 00:34:36.950
Broadway?

00:34:36.950 --> 00:34:41.160
Vandrande! A Pillar's core!
I explained it to you before!

00:34:41.160 --> 00:34:44.080
That's too hard! Can we say "Vandra?"

00:34:44.080 --> 00:34:48.950
We need to get the Vandra out of
the water and then destroy it, right?

00:34:48.950 --> 00:34:53.830
That's right. We don't have much
time to plan, though. Any thoughts?

00:34:53.830 --> 00:34:55.160
Me!

00:34:55.160 --> 00:34:56.080
Muguruma?

00:34:56.080 --> 00:34:59.580
It's unfair to hide in the water and attack!

00:34:59.580 --> 00:35:02.450
Shut up and listen, idiot!

00:35:02.450 --> 00:35:06.290
Honestly, we'll struggle
to fight an underwater enemy.

00:35:06.290 --> 00:35:09.200
We could attack once it's on land, but...

00:35:09.200 --> 00:35:14.160
Tateyama is a port town,
so the damage would be tremendous.

00:35:14.160 --> 00:35:18.040
You're right. We have to
prevent that no matter what.

00:35:18.040 --> 00:35:19.830
Obviously.

00:35:19.830 --> 00:35:22.660
So, I was thinking about a plan...

00:35:22.660 --> 00:35:26.250
Since it's underwater, how about we go fishing?

00:35:26.250 --> 00:35:28.950
Don't you be stupid too. Oh!

00:35:28.950 --> 00:35:30.290
No, that's it!

00:35:30.290 --> 00:35:31.950
We'll go fishing?

00:35:31.950 --> 00:35:36.120
Of course not!
What we'll do is treat it like a fish!

00:35:36.120 --> 00:35:37.750
Like a fish?

00:35:37.750 --> 00:35:40.660
Yeah! And the key to do that is...

00:35:40.660 --> 00:35:44.500
Stupid Miyako, wanna be part of my plan?

00:35:44.500 --> 00:35:46.750
That's my specialty!

00:35:46.750 --> 00:35:52.160
Pillar confirmed in water.
Change targets from Tertiary to Secondary.

00:35:52.160 --> 00:35:55.580
We're going from the trash to the mid-boss?

00:35:55.580 --> 00:35:57.330
You've gotta be kidding!

00:35:57.330 --> 00:36:01.580
Think of this as a chance
to show off to Claudia!

00:36:01.580 --> 00:36:06.410
What an annoying Pillar
to make her fight on her first day!

00:36:06.410 --> 00:36:09.410
Claudy? Worried about the plan?

00:36:09.410 --> 00:36:11.370
No. Not really.

00:36:11.370 --> 00:36:16.620
Don't worry! Azu may live a sloppy life,
but she's actually smart!

00:36:16.620 --> 00:36:18.120
I can hear you!

00:36:18.120 --> 00:36:22.410
Huh? I wasn't even talking loudly.

00:36:22.410 --> 00:36:23.870
Poor Azu.

00:36:23.870 --> 00:36:27.040
We're fighting a Secondary
we know nothing about.

00:36:27.040 --> 00:36:29.540
How are you so relaxed?

00:36:29.540 --> 00:36:35.040
We've got me, Azu, Sono,
and Claudy too! We can't lose!

00:36:35.040 --> 00:36:39.660
Miko doesn't know about
Claudy's history in Europe, right?

00:36:39.660 --> 00:36:42.620
This is why I can't handle idiots.

00:36:42.620 --> 00:36:46.450
Our idiot is one thing,
but you're part of the strategy too.

00:36:46.450 --> 00:36:48.660
You know that, right?

00:36:48.660 --> 00:36:51.330
Of course... But...

00:36:51.330 --> 00:36:52.410
But?

00:36:52.410 --> 00:36:56.040
I'm worried about fighting together.

00:36:57.830 --> 00:36:58.750
I...

00:36:58.750 --> 00:37:00.950
Hah! How unscientific!

00:37:00.950 --> 00:37:04.700
I'll get rid of your
worthless worries in seconds.

00:37:04.700 --> 00:37:06.700
Everyone, listen up!

00:37:06.700 --> 00:37:12.000
The new girl says she was called
"Grim Reaper" in Europe!

00:37:12.000 --> 00:37:15.200
Grim Reaper? As in, this attack is doomed?

00:37:15.200 --> 00:37:20.660
I mean, it's pretty bad luck to fight
a Pillar on your first day, but...

00:37:21.540 --> 00:37:24.660
Whatever! Our Grim Reaper's a beauty!

00:37:24.660 --> 00:37:27.790
Sounds like damn good luck to me!

00:37:27.790 --> 00:37:29.410
Damn straight!

00:37:29.410 --> 00:37:30.620
Huh?

00:37:34.200 --> 00:37:36.290
Well? You like that?

00:37:36.290 --> 00:37:39.250
Azu, that wasn't tactful at all.

00:37:39.250 --> 00:37:42.120
Huh?! That couldn't have gone better!

00:37:42.120 --> 00:37:45.000
You ought to study proper behavior.

00:37:45.000 --> 00:37:48.330
Hey, aren't you younger than me?

00:37:49.450 --> 00:37:55.000
Claudy... I'm not really good
with complicated things, but...

00:37:55.000 --> 00:38:00.040
I can tell you're a little happier now,
and that makes me glad!

00:38:04.080 --> 00:38:08.830
Valkyrie Wing,
change flight lead to Schwertleite.

00:38:08.830 --> 00:38:11.330
Also, good luck with the plan!

00:38:11.330 --> 00:38:12.370
Roger!

00:38:12.370 --> 00:38:14.000
Azu's demoted!

00:38:14.000 --> 00:38:16.330
For now! Just for today!

00:38:16.330 --> 00:38:19.000
Blade 1, we doing this?

00:38:19.620 --> 00:38:22.370
Yeah... Follow Blade 1!

00:38:22.370 --> 00:38:23.540
Copy!

00:38:23.540 --> 00:38:26.370
Well then. Dynamite Fishing Plan...

00:38:26.370 --> 00:38:28.040
...commence!

00:38:35.830 --> 00:38:38.000
Now!

00:38:38.000 --> 00:38:42.450
Hero Cannon, surprise fire!

00:38:44.370 --> 00:38:46.290
Dynamite Fishing Plan...

00:38:46.290 --> 00:38:48.910
The other names were worse.

00:38:48.910 --> 00:38:50.250
It's coming!

00:38:53.080 --> 00:38:54.950
Finally showed up, huh?

00:38:54.950 --> 00:38:56.540
That's one huge fish!

00:38:56.540 --> 00:38:59.200
I'm pretty sure it's a whale.

00:38:59.200 --> 00:39:04.410
We drew it out of the water,
so it should run out of energy eventually.

00:39:04.410 --> 00:39:06.700
It'll reach land if we stall!

00:39:06.700 --> 00:39:08.790
Then we proceed as planned!

00:39:08.790 --> 00:39:10.790
We blow it up with... Uh!

00:39:10.790 --> 00:39:11.620
What's wrong?!

00:39:11.620 --> 00:39:14.000
I shot two Hero Cannons back there!

00:39:14.000 --> 00:39:15.450
Are you serious?!

00:39:15.450 --> 00:39:17.450
I'll go rearm!

00:39:18.000 --> 00:39:21.160
Whoa! They're after me!

00:39:21.160 --> 00:39:23.160
I'll cover you! Just go!

00:39:23.160 --> 00:39:24.120
Roger!

00:39:24.120 --> 00:39:26.290
Shield Squadron, protect Red!

00:39:26.290 --> 00:39:28.330
Understood! Leave it to us!

00:39:28.330 --> 00:39:29.500
And us?

00:39:29.500 --> 00:39:32.290
Try to cut down on their numbers!

00:39:32.290 --> 00:39:33.700
Roger!

00:39:37.000 --> 00:39:39.370
What the hell! You see that?!

00:39:39.370 --> 00:39:40.830
Can you pull that off?

00:39:40.830 --> 00:39:42.660
No way! No chance in hell!

00:39:42.660 --> 00:39:44.750
Named are sick!

00:39:44.750 --> 00:39:48.250
Anonym, you're too deep!
Don't try to imitate me!

00:39:48.250 --> 00:39:51.580
I'm not trying to! Besides, I've got this!

00:39:51.580 --> 00:39:53.870
Sondergerät!

00:39:56.500 --> 00:39:57.700
What was that?!

00:39:57.700 --> 00:40:02.290
Azu tinkers with her Hero Wing
and puts weird equipment on it.

00:40:02.290 --> 00:40:04.870
She does?! Is that allowed?!

00:40:04.870 --> 00:40:08.750
Look how it turned out!
When you're a genius like me--

00:40:08.750 --> 00:40:09.620
Azu!

00:40:09.620 --> 00:40:10.700
Let's help her!

00:40:10.700 --> 00:40:12.540
Coming as fast as I can!

00:40:12.540 --> 00:40:15.620
Super Charger, on!

00:40:15.620 --> 00:40:17.040
Now!

00:40:18.620 --> 00:40:22.830
Whew! Look at our girls go!
They're keeping up with a Named!

00:40:22.830 --> 00:40:27.080
Gah! I've gotta get back in the action!

00:40:27.080 --> 00:40:31.450
There's no end to 'em.
We've gotta take down the main one.

00:40:31.450 --> 00:40:34.830
Pink? What's she planning to do?

00:40:34.830 --> 00:40:36.620
Here goes!

00:40:44.000 --> 00:40:45.870
That was so reckless!

00:40:45.870 --> 00:40:48.450
You might not think it 'cuz she's timid,

00:40:48.450 --> 00:40:52.410
but Sono is the craziest out of all of us.

00:40:52.410 --> 00:40:55.370
I can hear you. Whew! That was scary!

00:40:55.370 --> 00:40:57.200
Liar!

00:40:58.790 --> 00:41:00.250
That's...!

00:41:00.250 --> 00:41:01.540
Sorry to keep you!

00:41:01.540 --> 00:41:02.910
And? Your missiles?

00:41:02.910 --> 00:41:03.910
Got some!

00:41:03.910 --> 00:41:07.120
Good! We just gotta find the Vandrande now.

00:41:07.120 --> 00:41:07.950
Right there.

00:41:07.950 --> 00:41:09.160
You can tell?

00:41:09.160 --> 00:41:10.200
Yeah.

00:41:10.200 --> 00:41:13.660
Not even our idiot could
break through that many.

00:41:13.660 --> 00:41:15.000
In that case...

00:41:15.000 --> 00:41:16.700
We'll do it together!

00:41:16.700 --> 00:41:19.950
Make it rain! Shoot everything you've got!

00:41:19.950 --> 00:41:21.540
Roger that!

00:41:21.540 --> 00:41:23.330
Copy!

00:41:23.330 --> 00:41:25.080
Okay!

00:41:25.080 --> 00:41:27.660
You all just do your own thing.

00:41:33.540 --> 00:41:35.250
One!

00:41:35.250 --> 00:41:39.120
It's been a while since
I tailed anyone! Take this!

00:41:40.660 --> 00:41:42.370
Two!

00:41:42.370 --> 00:41:46.410
Modified warhead! Gouge a hole through!

00:41:46.410 --> 00:41:49.000
Three! Go for it, Miyako!

00:41:49.000 --> 00:41:54.500
Hero Cannon returns! Go!

00:41:58.750 --> 00:41:59.790
Did it work?

00:41:59.790 --> 00:42:02.790
That's a bad thing to ask.

00:42:02.790 --> 00:42:04.790
It's closing! Disengage!

00:42:04.790 --> 00:42:07.500
No! The Vandra's right there!

00:42:08.370 --> 00:42:11.120
That idiot! What's she doing?!

00:42:22.160 --> 00:42:22.950
Miyako!

00:42:22.950 --> 00:42:24.120
Miko!

00:42:29.950 --> 00:42:33.750
Am I... the only one again?

00:42:33.750 --> 00:42:36.160
I'm the Grim Reaper.

00:42:36.160 --> 00:42:39.660
That's right. You're the Grim Reaper.

00:42:39.660 --> 00:42:42.000
Grim Reaper Claudia.

00:42:46.080 --> 00:42:48.040
Come in.

00:42:51.870 --> 00:42:55.080
This is Schwertleite.

00:42:55.080 --> 00:42:56.700
Come in.

00:43:00.910 --> 00:43:03.290
Someone...

00:43:03.290 --> 00:43:06.080
Please, someone come in.

00:43:09.330 --> 00:43:11.000
Pink...

00:43:11.000 --> 00:43:12.950
Anonym...

00:43:16.330 --> 00:43:20.500
Red... No...

00:43:20.500 --> 00:43:22.580
Miyako!

00:43:29.540 --> 00:43:33.790
Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!

00:43:33.790 --> 00:43:35.830
Me! That's me!

00:43:35.830 --> 00:43:37.870
That's me, Miyako! Miyako!

00:43:37.870 --> 00:43:43.250
Argh, shut up! Quit repeating yourself!
What's wrong with you?!

00:43:43.250 --> 00:43:47.700
Because! It's the first time
Claudy called me by my name!

00:43:47.700 --> 00:43:50.000
Is it really <i>that</i> exciting?!

00:43:50.000 --> 00:43:51.660
You jealous, Azu?

00:43:51.660 --> 00:43:53.410
In your dreams!

00:43:53.410 --> 00:43:57.000
Claudy! I'm Miyako!

00:43:57.660 --> 00:44:01.540
Uh, we're confirming four Valkyrie here too.

00:44:01.540 --> 00:44:04.450
And no signs of the Pillar at all.

00:44:04.450 --> 00:44:06.660
Copy that.

00:44:06.660 --> 00:44:08.330
One more thing...

00:44:08.330 --> 00:44:10.790
Good job on your first mission.

00:44:14.450 --> 00:44:16.950
Coming home.

00:44:16.950 --> 00:44:19.700
What kind of idiot pulls that stunt?!

00:44:19.700 --> 00:44:21.660
What do you mean by "stunt"?

00:44:21.660 --> 00:44:24.500
The end! You jumped out and attacked it!

00:44:24.500 --> 00:44:28.080
But we won! I'm so glad I brought my katana!

00:44:28.080 --> 00:44:29.830
We're safe! Vrictory!

00:44:29.830 --> 00:44:32.080
It's not "vrictory"!

00:44:32.080 --> 00:44:33.830
Good work today.

00:44:33.830 --> 00:44:39.080
Miko and Azu seem full of life,
but I'm totally worn out.

00:44:39.080 --> 00:44:42.370
I imagine. You were pretty courageous today.

00:44:42.370 --> 00:44:44.790
"You"? Is that it?

00:44:44.790 --> 00:44:47.500
Miko was Miyako, right?

00:44:47.500 --> 00:44:49.620
U-Uh...

00:44:49.620 --> 00:44:51.790
Oh well. Time's up.

00:44:51.790 --> 00:44:53.080
Huh?

00:45:03.250 --> 00:45:05.160
Good work, everyone!

00:45:05.160 --> 00:45:06.410
Oh, Miko!

00:45:06.410 --> 00:45:08.830
Heard you were crazy again!

00:45:20.290 --> 00:45:22.080
It's beautiful.

00:45:22.080 --> 00:45:25.250
Oh! Shoot! I almost forgot!

00:45:25.250 --> 00:45:27.620
Claudy!

00:45:30.370 --> 00:45:33.040
Welcome to Tateyama Base!

00:45:33.160 --> 00:45:35.410
"Episode 1: Welcome to Tateyama Base!"

00:45:47.620 --> 00:45:49.790
Thanks.

00:45:49.790 --> 00:45:53.950
Claudia Bruford, reporting for duty!

00:47:27.500 --> 00:47:29.330
Announcing our favorite girls!

00:47:29.330 --> 00:47:30.500
Cute, kinda sly!

00:47:30.500 --> 00:47:31.330
Sonoka!

00:47:31.330 --> 00:47:32.580
Brave, cool, airhead!

00:47:32.580 --> 00:47:33.250
Claudy!

00:47:33.250 --> 00:47:34.830
Our bright smiled...

00:47:34.830 --> 00:47:35.500
...Miyako!

00:47:35.500 --> 00:47:37.330
Smart, cute, loves Miyako!

00:47:37.330 --> 00:47:38.540
Adorable...

00:47:38.540 --> 00:47:39.790
"Next Time"
"Episode 2: Umihotaru Sea Assault!"
...Azuzu!

00:47:39.790 --> 00:47:42.000
"Next Time"
"Episode 2: Umihotaru Sea Assault!"
